#: src/questions/04-resource-allocation.html.j2:113
msgid ""
"We will be archiving data in cold storage systems for long-term preservation"
" already during the project."
msgid_plural ""
"We will be archiving data in cold storage systems for long-term preservation"
" already during the projects."
msgstr[0] ""
"Data budeme archivovat v archivních úložištích pro dlouhodobé uchování již "
